.Dd September 30, 2026
.Dt KLDLOAD-WIN 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm kldload-win
.Nd open one web-console view as its own application window
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar view
.Op Ar window-class
.Nm
.Fl h | -help
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Opens the web console's
.Ar view
in a Chrome application window without the console's side navigation
and without Chrome's warning bars, in a profile all such windows share,
so several can be open at once.
.Ar window-class
names the window for the desktop's dock and icon.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Print usage and exit 0.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr kldload-dashboard 8 ,
.Xr kldload-webui 8
.Sh AUTHORS
.An kldload Aq Mt anthony@kldload.com
